Z||000003||tomanyfieros||10-24-2001||06:38 PM||||thats strange, why is it an 86 GT? 88's were the only ones that came with ttops.... not saying that it is not factory, i know my 87 GT is not factory ttoped because me and a friend put them in.... anyways, why is it an 86 GT? why cant it be an 88????  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> ?<BR>Jason<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dreamer.gif">    <BR><B>We all have dreams, but not everyone gets them...</B>||||reg||1
